I know you want to be polite, but you've already made contact with them.

230
00:13:11,550 --> 00:13:14,950
So in English, you can be a bit more relaxed in the opening.

231
00:13:15,390 --> 00:13:16,370
Okay, more relaxed.

232
00:13:17,280 --> 00:13:18,280
Got it.

233
00:13:18,280 --> 00:13:19,420
Hey, Sally, what's up?

234
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:20,480
It's Tracy here.

235
00:13:21,140 --> 00:13:21,560
Just...

236
00:13:22,320 --> 00:13:22,440
Okay, Tracy.

237
00:13:23,440 --> 00:13:24,740
Now it's too relaxed.

238
00:13:25,720 --> 00:13:27,880
You've still got to show some respect.

239
00:13:27,880 --> 00:13:30,820
How about starting with Dear Miss Cooper, I'm writing to confirm...

240
00:13:31,840 --> 00:13:32,120
Great.

241
00:13:32,300 --> 00:13:32,440
Okay.

242
